<title>THAILAND: Thai stocks market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Thai stocks market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Thailand was closed on Monday for the Coronation Day public holiday.</p>
<p>The composite SET index finished 1.19 points lower at 660.10 on tin trade on Friday. The SET - 50 index drop 0.20 point to 48.72.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
